  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/tool1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. At dev 100b6fbb6e both ids are still in all four lists (ci.yml:437, release.yml:88, woodpecker.yml:166, release-check:278). Local env has pytest 9.0.3 and pip 26.2.2 (not affected), and syrupy 4.8.0 sits beside pytest 9.0.3, so the ci.yml comment 'pinned below 9.0.0 by syrupy' is stale. The runner-env measurement (the PR's CI audit job) still needs CI/network and was not run. MECHANISM: a vulnerability ignore outlives its cause and would hide the next advisory under the same id. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-totak."  # 70ca
